A||||26||beer_stud_21||What do you guys pay for insurance?||||5||
Z||000000||beer_stud_21||01-23-2001||11:40 PM||||I know peoples costs will vary depending on driving records etc but I want to know if you guys (and gals... hehe) are having to pay bloated costs for insurance on your fieros.  I've read on the net that it is extra expensive to insure a fiero.  I added a v6 t-bird to my parents insurance a few  months ago.  Came out to about $150.00 for six months for the most basic hawaii no-fault insurance.  This was with the t-bird being a second vehicle on the insurance plan and a perfect driving record.  I'm schemeing on getting a wingless 85gt auto and want to make sure there isnt going to be any hidden mile high insurnace bills when i get it.  Also any 19-20 yr old guys on here payin insurnace on only the fiero.  Ive heard its lots more expensive that way.<P>thanks all..<P>-Marlin||||reg||5
Z||000001||RaeQwan||01-23-2001||11:45 PM||||my brother, whos car I drive(88 fiero), pays like 380$ for 6months.. with 3 cars.. my 88, a 93 Stealth(good lord expensive) and a 65 Truck.. I was personally paying around 650$ for 6 months for my car before he got it<P>------------------<BR>Ray - AIM: WookieeNC<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Fiero Coupe</A> - <A HREF="http://www.CarolinaFieros.com" TARGET=_blank>Carolina Fieros</A> - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.net" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Network</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||beer_stud_21||01-23-2001||11:48 PM||||I've got two things to say to that...  #1 Damn you people respond to posts fast... and... #2  Damn thats some expensive insurance.  But you didnt say if it was full coverage or what..<P>peace out...<P>-Marlin||||reg||11
Z||000003||RaeQwan||01-24-2001||12:46 AM||||liability only.. on all 3, for full coverage on the stealth by itself, it'd be over a grand per 6months  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Ray - AIM: WookieeNC<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Fiero Coupe</A> - <A HREF="http://www.CarolinaFieros.com" TARGET=_blank>Carolina Fieros</A> - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.net" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Network</A>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||01-24-2001||07:57 AM||||When my Fieros are both on the road with my daily driver, 99 Buick GS, my rates go up $100/month.  I carry high coverage with high deductible ($1000)for the cars.  So two cars cost me about $600/six months.||||reg||3
