Z||000023||2birds||01-24-2001||09:15 PM||||My 86 GT cost me $150 a month when I bought it in 1988, but I was 20 and single then.  Dropped to $100/mo at 21, $50/mo when I got married a year later.  Full coverage, 250 deductible.  No accidents, never more than one really minor speeding ticket at a time, none since 92.  Fiero costs me around 40/mo now. My 97 V-8 T-bird is $60/mo.  Dropping collision only saves me bout $15/mo.  Always with State Farm, including Life and Homeowners.  <P>Like death and taxes, you still gotta have it, but you don't want to use it.||||reg||1
